<title>THAILAND: Thai Glass first quarter net drops.</title>
<headline>Thai Glass first quarter net drops.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997			   1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     1.88	 vs		2.64</p>
<p>    Net		    110.02	 vs	    154.51</p>
<p>Notes: Results are reviewed. Company's full name is Thai Glass Industry Plc, a glass producing firm.</p>
